<title>USA: Minnesota Mining raises quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Minnesota Mining raises quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minnesota Mining and Manufacturing Co said Monday its directors increased the quarterly dividend 8.2 percent to $0.53 a share.</p>
<p>The cash dividend is payable March 12 to stockholders of record on February 21.</p>
<p>As of December 31, 1996, 3M had 416,836,008 shares outstanding. There were about 132,400 shareholders of record.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
